  "setting": "臨海山城的石板平台",
  "subtitle": "",
  "subtitle_en": "",
  "lead": "有一天，所有東西都變輕了一點，輕到一鬆手，就會慢慢浮起來。",
  "lead_en": "One day everything became a little lighter, light enough to drift up the moment you let go.",
  "statement_title": "",
  "statement": "有一天，所有東西都變輕了一點，輕到一鬆手，就會慢慢浮起來。\n\n那天她替一個人搬家。\n他留下了一整個家，只放走了一疊信。",
  "statement_en": "One day everything became a little lighter, light enough to drift up the moment you let go.\n\nThat day she was moving a man out of his home.\nHe kept the whole house, and let go of only a bundle of letters.",
  "afterword": "那天她替一個人搬家。\n他留下了一整個家，只放走了一疊信。",
  "afterword_en": "That day she was moving a man out of his home.\nHe kept the whole house, and let go of only a bundle of letters.",
  "series_statement": "《神話未完成》\n史旺姬走進流傳至今的神話，留下它最核心的問題，讓它面對今天的生活。神話一直被講述、被使用，所以還沒有完成。",
  "series_statement_en": "Myths in the Making\nSwanky Ji steps into myths that are still being told, keeps the question at their heart, and lets it meet the life we live now. A myth that is still told and still used is not yet finished.",
